VII. STANDARDIZED CREDENTIALS

The Nahouri system establishes three major universal educational credentials.

N9 — Nahouri Primary Certificate

Awarded following completion of Primary VI.

N15 — Nahouri Global Secondary Diploma

Awarded following completion of Secondary VI.

This becomes the internationally standardized secondary-school qualification.

N18 — Nahouri Bachelor of Global Education

Awarded following completion of University III.

Professional degrees may require additional standardized years.

